{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"89944","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/89944","key":"MC-262505","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"10/May/23 6:31 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n<p>\n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-1133\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-1133\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"Whether or not a player experiences some effect is calculated based on the block under the center of the player\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-1133\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n was fixed in 23w18a, and \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-262424\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-262424\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"Sprinting particles on the edges of blocks are still incorrect\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-262424\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n was fixed in 1.20 pre-release 1. However, iron golems produce step particles for blocks they walk on, and these can be for blocks they're not colliding with, and are generated in midair.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce\"></a>How to reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Build a setup like this:  <span class=\"image-wrap\" style=\"\"><a id=\"117062_thumb\" href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/117062\" title=\"2023-05-10_14.23.30.png\" file-preview-type=\"image\" file-preview-id=\"117062\" file-preview-title=\"2023-05-10_14.23.30.png\"><jira-attachment-thumbnail url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/117062?default=false\" jira-url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/117062\" filename=\"2023-05-10_14.23.30.png\"><img src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/117062\" data-attachment-name=\"2023-05-10_14.23.30.png\" data-attachment-type=\"thumbnail\" data-media-services-id=\"7cc63f5d-3180-45e1-a5c2-41ef0601c67f\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" style=\"border: 0px solid black\"></jira-attachment-thumbnail></a></span></li>\n\t<li>Create an iron golem within</li>\n\t<li>Observe as it walks</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Expectedresults\"></a>Expected results</h3>\n<p>The particles generated by the iron golem as it walks would only be those of the solid full blocks it collides with, and would always be generated above those solid blocks.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Actualresults\"></a>Actual results</h3>\n<p>It creates particles of the blocks it's not colliding with as well, and oftentimes these are created in midair.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"10/May/23 3:02 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/117062","id":"117062","filename":"2023-05-10_14.23.30.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-